<div class="splash-1">
  <%= image_tag 'logo-md.png' %>
  <ul>
    <li><%= link_to 'About Us', '#about-us' %></li>
    <li><%= link_to 'Why Sportsbeep', '#why-sportsbeep' %></li>
    <li><%= link_to 'Sign Up', new_user_registration_path %></li>
    <li><%= link_to (current_user ? 'Play' : 'Login & Play'), play_path %></li>
    <li><%= link_to 'Contact', '#contact-us' %></li>
  </ul>
</div>
<div class="about-us">
  <div class="landing-padding">
    <a name="about-us"></a>
    <header>About Sportsbeep</header>
    <p>
      Sportsbeep intends to be at the forefront of Fantasy Sports entertainment and gaming. By providing a faster, easier,
      and richer approach to gaming and communications, Sportsbeep believes it will become an integral part of its users’ daily lives.
      Sportsbeep’s top priority is to build a gaming platform that enables users to connect, interact and recruit other fantasy
      sports players. The Company wants its users to discover, learn and win cash prizes, all the while becoming smarter sports fans
      by using the platform. Sportsbeep’s business structure is low cost and web based. However, Sportsbeep’s reach can extend to
      millions of site hits on a daily basis. It has no physical products to manufacture; no cost of goods sold; no inventory or
      warehousing needs; no freight or insurance costs; zero shipping or packaging; zero need for massive real-estate space, leasing,
      offices or labor costs. The electronic nature of the automated services sold, avoids all the usual “brick and mortar” business
      expenditures with all of their inherent risks.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="splash-2">
  <a name="why-sportsbeep"></a>
  <div class="ad">
    <p>
      PLAY, WIN, EARN &amp; SHARE
      <br>
      with the leader in one day fantasy sports
    </p>
    <p>
      Free &amp; paid games available.
    </p>
    <p>
      NO long-term commitment.
      <br>
      Simply Play when you want!
    </p>
    <%= link_to 'Play Now!', play_path, class: 'play-btn' %>
    <p>
      Also available on
      <br>
      <%= image_tag 'landing-googleplay.png' %>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="phones">
    <%= image_tag 'landing-phones.png' %>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="clearfix"></div>
<div class="twitter-block">
  <%= image_tag 'twitter-logo.png' %>
  <header>What our Twitter followers are talking about</header>
  <a class="twitter-timeline" data-dnt="true" href="https://twitter.com/search?q=%23sportsbeep%20OR%20%40Sportsbeep" data-widget-id="540585371449692160">Tweets about #sportsbeep OR @Sportsbeep</a>
  <script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,"script","twitter-wjs");</script>
</div>
<div class="play-now-banner">
  <%= link_to 'Play Now!', play_path, class: 'play-btn' %>
</div>
<div class="footer">
  <a name="contact-us"></a>
  <footer>
    <div class="contact">
      <span class="footer-header">Sportsbeep</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Phone: 610-776-7872</li>
        <li><%= mail_to 'support@sportsbeep.com' %></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="other-links">
      <span class="footer-header">Other Links</span>
      <ul>
        <li><%= link_to 'Privacy Policy', privacy_policy_path %></li>
        <li><%= link_to 'Refund Policy', refund_policy_path %></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="follow-us">
      <span class="footer-header">Also follow us on:</span>
      <ul>
        <li class="social-icon facebook">
          <%= link_to 'https://www.facebook.com/sportsbeep' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-facebook"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <li class="social-icon twitter">
          <%= link_to 'https://twitter.com/Sportsbeep' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-twitter"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <li class="social-icon youtube">
          <%= link_to 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwcPSE82w0aYSspC8bZjlsg' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-youtube"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <li class="social-icon tumblr">
          <%= link_to 'https://www.tumblr.com/blog/sportsbeepapp' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-tumblr"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <li class="social-icon pinterest">
          <%= link_to 'http://www.pinterest.com/Sportsbeep/' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-pinterest"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <li class="social-icon instagram">
          <%= link_to 'http://instagram.com/sportsbeep' do %>
            <i class="fa fa-instagram"></i>
          <% end %>
        </li>
        <div class="clearfix"></div>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>